# History navigation inside readline: previous/next-history,
# beginning/end-of-history, fetch-history, operate-and-get-next,
# modified history lines, history-preserve-point.
tags: history navigation
--- script
add_history "first one"
add_history "second two"
add_history "third three"
readline "> "

=== previous-history-once
tags: previous-history
keys: \C-p<dumpfull>\r

=== previous-history-to-start-and-beyond
tags: previous-history
keys: \C-p\C-p\C-p<dump>\C-p<dump>\r

=== previous-history-count
tags: previous-history numarg
keys: \M-2\C-p<dump>\r

=== previous-history-negative-count
tags: previous-history numarg
keys: \C-p\C-p\C-p\M--\C-p<dump>\r

=== previous-history-up-arrow
tags: previous-history
keys: <up><up><dump><down><dump>\r

=== next-history-back-to-current
tags: next-history
keys: typed\C-p\C-p<dump>\C-n\C-n<dumpfull>\r

=== next-history-at-end-dings
tags: next-history
keys: abc\C-n<dump>\r

=== next-history-count
tags: next-history numarg
keys: \C-p\C-p\C-p\M-2\C-n<dump>\r

=== next-history-negative-count
tags: next-history numarg
keys: \M--\M-2\C-n<dump>\r

=== beginning-of-history
tags: beginning-of-history
keys: abc\M-<<dumpfull>\r

=== end-of-history
tags: end-of-history
keys: typed\M-<\M-><dumpfull>\r

=== history-point-at-end
tags: previous-history
keys: abc\C-a\C-p<dump>\r

=== history-preserve-point
tags: previous-history history-preserve-point vars
--- inputrc
set history-preserve-point on
--- keys
abcdefgh\C-a\C-f\C-f\C-f\C-f<dump>\C-p<dump>\C-p<dump>\C-n\C-n<dump>\r

=== history-preserve-point-short-line
tags: previous-history history-preserve-point vars
--- inputrc
set history-preserve-point on
--- script
add_history "ab"
add_history "a long history line"
readline "> "
--- keys
\C-p\C-a\M-f\M-f<dump>\C-p<dump>\C-n<dump>\r

=== modified-history-line-kept
tags: previous-history
keys: \C-pX\C-p\C-n<dump>\C-n<dump>\C-p<dump>\r

=== modified-history-line-returned-not-saved
tags: previous-history
--- script
add_history "first one"
add_history "second two"
readline "> "
history_dump
using_history
readline "> "
--- keys
\C-p MOD\r\C-p\C-p<dump>\r
ignore: results[1].entries[*].data

=== modified-history-mark-modified-lines
tags: mark-modified-lines vars display
--- inputrc
set mark-modified-lines on
--- keys
\C-pX<snap>\C-p<snap>\C-n<snap>\r

=== mark-modified-lines-off
tags: mark-modified-lines vars display
--- keys
\C-pX<snap>\C-p<snap>\C-n<snap>\r

=== current-line-saved-while-browsing
tags: previous-history next-history
keys: draft\C-p\C-p\C-n\C-n<dump>\r

=== empty-history-previous
tags: previous-history
--- script
readline "> "
--- keys
abc\C-p<dump>\M-<<dump>\r

=== fetch-history-with-arg
tags: fetch-history
--- inputrc
"\C-xf": fetch-history
--- keys
\M-2\C-xf<dump>\r

=== fetch-history-no-arg
tags: fetch-history
--- inputrc
"\C-xf": fetch-history
--- keys
abc\C-xf<dump>\r

=== fetch-history-out-of-range
tags: fetch-history
--- inputrc
"\C-xf": fetch-history
--- keys
\M-9\C-xf<dump>\r

=== fetch-history-negative
tags: fetch-history
--- inputrc
"\C-xf": fetch-history
--- keys
\M--\M-1\C-xf<dump>\r

=== fetch-history-history-base
tags: fetch-history
--- inputrc
"\C-xf": fetch-history
--- script
add_history "a"
add_history "b"
add_history "c"
set history_base 10
readline "> "
--- keys
\M-1\M-1\C-xf<dump>\r

=== operate-and-get-next
tags: operate-and-get-next
--- script
add_history "first one"
add_history "second two"
add_history "third three"
readline "> " 3 addhist
history_dump
--- keys
\C-p\C-p\C-p\C-o<dump>\C-o<dump>\r

=== operate-and-get-next-with-arg
tags: operate-and-get-next numarg
--- script
add_history "first one"
add_history "second two"
add_history "third three"
readline "> " 2 addhist
--- keys
\C-p\C-p\C-p\M-2\C-o<dump>\r

=== operate-and-get-next-at-end
tags: operate-and-get-next
--- script
readline "> " 2 addhist
--- keys
new\C-o<dump>\r

=== operate-and-get-next-stifled
tags: operate-and-get-next
--- script
add_history "one"
add_history "two"
add_history "three"
stifle_history 3
readline "> " 2 addhist
--- keys
\C-p\C-p\C-o<dump>\r

=== history-across-readline-calls
tags: previous-history
--- script
readline "> " 3 addhist
--- keys
a1\rb2\r\C-p\C-p<dump>\r

=== history-navigation-in-callback
tags: previous-history callback
--- script
add_history "first one"
add_history "second two"
callback "> "
--- keys
\C-p\C-p<dump>\C-n<dump>\r

=== history-display-long-entry
tags: previous-history display
screen: 20x6
--- script
add_history "short"
add_history "a much longer line that wraps around"
readline "> "
--- keys
\C-p<snap>\C-p<snap>\C-n<snap>\r

=== history-undo-list-per-entry
tags: previous-history undo
keys: \C-pA\C-pB\C-n\C-_<dump>\C-p\C-_<dump>\r

=== maybe-save-unsave-line-api
tags: rl_maybe_save_line rl_maybe_unsave_line api
--- script
def s
rl_maybe_save_line
rl_replace_line "temporary" 0
end
def u
rl_maybe_unsave_line
end
defun save-line s
defun unsave-line u
rl_bind_keyseq "\C-xs" save-line
rl_bind_keyseq "\C-xu" unsave-line
readline "> "
--- keys
draft\C-xs<dump>\C-xu<dump>\r

=== maybe-replace-line-api
tags: rl_maybe_replace_line api
--- script
add_history "orig"
def r
rl_maybe_replace_line
end
defun repl-line r
rl_bind_keyseq "\C-xr" repl-line
readline "> "
history_dump
--- keys
\C-pX\C-xr\C-n\C-p<dump>\r
ignore: results[*].entries[*].data

=== get-previous-history-api
tags: rl_get_previous_history api
--- script
add_history "first one"
add_history "second two"
add_history "third three"
def p
rl_get_previous_history 2 0
end
defun prev2 p
rl_bind_keyseq "\C-xp" prev2
readline "> "
--- keys
\C-xp<dump>\r

=== beginning-of-history-api-outside
tags: rl_beginning_of_history api
--- script
add_history "x1"
add_history "x2"
rl_initialize
rl_beginning_of_history 1 0
dump
rl_end_of_history 1 0
dump
